From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SWEEP-Bench <sweep-bench@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] Past frames from a subset of the cameras

data.train.history_camera_keys (default None: every camera) keeps only the
named cameras in each history frame. The narrower history latent is
right-padded to the current width and its padding tokens are hidden from
attention, which equals a sequence without them. FastWAMIDM and
infer_joint refuse narrow history.
